The delivery queue lives here, and nothing in this directory is committed.

The folder itself is, though — as this file. tgbot.service names it in
ReadWritePaths, and systemd refuses to start a unit whose ReadWritePaths point
at a directory that does not exist yet: it fails at namespace setup with
226/NAMESPACE, before Python runs, naming the path but not the reason. A clone
that has never run the bot would hit that every time.
